+  <td class="ipa">/ˈɑnʃɛˈtɑʊr/</td>
+  <td>Sun-people. (The Sunwalkers.)</td>
+  <td>Attested <em>An'she</em> (sun) + inferred <em>taur</em> (people/earth); <strong>speculative compound</strong> — assumes modifier-head compound order</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
