+<h2 id="gnomish">Gnomish Constructed Sentences</h2>
+
+<p>Based on the grammar in <a href="gnomish/grammar.md">gnomish/grammar.md</a>.
+Key patterns used: *Mech-*/*Mekka-* root for machine/craft; *Gnom-* self-designation root;
+right-headed compounding (inherited from Titan); *-regan*/*-agon* place suffix pattern.
+Gnomish has <strong>no attested sentences at all</strong> — not a single Gnomish-language
+phrase is known. All constructions below are compound juxtapositions using inferred morphemes,
+with syntax entirely hypothetical.</p>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>#</th><th>Sentence</th><th>IPA</th><th>Gloss</th><th>Grammar Used</th></tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn1</td>
+  <td>Gnom-eregan, Mekkatorque.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈnoʊmɛrɛɡæn ˈmɛkətɔːrk/</td>
+  <td>Gnome-city, Machine-[title].</td>
+  <td>Attested *Gnomeregan* (decomposed as *Gnom-* + *-eregan*) + attested *Mekkatorque* (decomposed as *Mekka-* + *-torque*); juxtaposition of two confirmed place/title names</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn2</td>
+  <td>Mech-agon, Mim-iron.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈmɛkəɡɒn ˈmɪmɪrɒn/</td>
+  <td>Machine-place, Architect-[honorific].</td>
+  <td>Attested *Mechagon* (decomposed *Mech-* + *-agon*) + attested *Mimiron* (decomposed *Mim-* + *-iron*); juxtaposition of place name and creator name</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn3</td>
+  <td>Mek-gineer, Gnom.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈmɛkdʒɪnɪər noʊm/</td>
+  <td>Machine-engineer, Gnome.</td>
+  <td>Attested title *Mekgineer* (decomposed *Mek-* + *gineer*) + attested *Gnom* root; <strong>speculative</strong> — assumes *Gnom* can stand as a free noun</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn4</td>
+  <td>Mecha-gnome, Mech-agon.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈmɛkənoʊm ˈmɛkəɡɒn/</td>
+  <td>Machine-gnome, Machine-place.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Mechagnome* + attested *Mechagon*; both share the *Mech-* root; juxtaposition demonstrating parallel compounding</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn5</td>
+  <td>Gnom-eregan, Mek-agon.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈnoʊmɛrɛɡæn ˈmɛkəɡɒn/</td>
+  <td>Gnome-city, Machine-city.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Gnomeregan* + coined *Mekagon* (regularized from *Mechagon* using *Mek-* variant); <strong>speculative</strong> — parallel structure highlighting the *-regan*/*-agon* suffix pair</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gn6</td>
+  <td>Mim-iron, Mek-torque.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈmɪmɪrɒn ˈmɛktɔːrk/</td>
+  <td>Creator-[honorific], Machine-[title].</td>
+  <td>Attested *Mimiron* + attested *Mekkatorque* (regularized as *Mek-torque*); <strong>speculative</strong> — assumes *Mim-* (creator) and *Mek-* (machine) are related Titan-derived roots</td>
