+*-an* elemental name suffix; elemental lexical fields (fire, wind, water, earth).
+Kalimag has <strong>no attested sentences at all</strong> — only proper names and
+a few unconfirmed words. All constructions below are compound juxtapositions using
+attested morphemes.</p>
