<h1>Alien Languages of Azeroth</h1>

<p>A comparative analysis of the four &ldquo;alien&rdquo; languages of World of Warcraft:
<a href="shath-yar/description.md">Shath&rsquo;Yar</a> (Old Gods and their servants),
<a href="nerubian/description.md">Nerubian</a> (spider-people of Azj-Kahet),
