+<h2 id="arathi">Arathi &amp; Hallowfall Names (TWW)</h2>
+
+<p>The Arathi of Hallowfall are a mixed human–high-elf population descended from an expedition
+sent by the Arathi Empire 15 years before TWW. Their names reflect Common (Vrykul-descended)
+and possibly Elven phonological features.</p>
+
+<h3>Arathi Personal Names</h3>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>Name</th><th>IPA</th><th>Context</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
+<tr><td>Faerin Lothar</td><td class="ipa">/ˈfɛərɪn/</td><td>Arathi Lamplighter</td><td>"Lothar" = Arathi dynasty; "Faerin" may be Elven-influenced</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Vaelisia Steelstrike</td><td class="ipa">/vɛˈliːsiə/</td><td>General of Arathi military</td><td>Given name has Elven features; surname is Common compound</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Aelric Leid</td><td class="ipa">/ˈɛlrɪk/</td><td>Leader of the Order of Night</td><td>Germanic/Old English style; not clearly Elven</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Marran Trollbane</td><td class="ipa">/ˈmærən/</td><td>Stromgarde noble (Legacy of Arathor)</td><td>Common name; "Trollbane" is hereditary compound surname</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Veronica Nials</td><td class="ipa">/vəˈrɒnɪkə/</td><td>Stromgarde military (Legacy of Arathor)</td><td>Latin/English; no Vrykul morphemes</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Danath Trollbane</td><td class="ipa">/ˈdænəθ/</td><td>Lord of Stromgarde (Legacy of Arathor)</td><td>Current ruler; "Trollbane" = hereditary surname</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Venrie Flitter</td><td class="ipa">/ˈvɛnri/</td><td>Arathi skiff operator</td><td>"Flitter" = Common descriptive surname</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Alyza Bowblaze</td><td class="ipa">/əˈlaɪzə/</td><td>Arathi (orphan quest)</td><td>"Bowblaze" = Common compound surname</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Kyrie</td><td class="ipa">/ˈkɪriːeɪ/</td><td>Arathi pet trainer</td><td>Greek-derived; Common-language</td></tr>
+</table>
+
+<h3>Hallowfall Place Names</h3>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>Name</th><th>IPA</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
+<tr><td>Mereldar</td><td class="ipa">/mɛˈrɛldɑːr/</td><td>Arathi city; <span class="inferred"><em>-dar</em></span> suffix may be Earthen substrate</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Beledar</td><td class="ipa">/bɛˈlɛdɑːr/</td><td>Crystal in ceiling; <span class="inferred"><em>-dar</em></span> suffix</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Dunelle's Kindness</td><td>—</td><td>Arathi personal name + Common possessive</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Sina's Yearning</td><td>—</td><td>Arathi personal name + Common possessive</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Tanir's Ascent</td><td>—</td><td>Arathi personal name + Common possessive</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Tenvir's Ascent</td><td>—</td><td>Arathi personal name + Common possessive</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Velhan's Claim</td><td>—</td><td>Arathi personal name + Common possessive</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Light's Redoubt</td><td>—</td><td>Common compound</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Priory of the Sacred Flame</td><td>—</td><td>Common compound</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Aegis Wall</td><td>—</td><td>Common compound; border against nerubians</td></tr>
+<tr><td>The Hungering Pool</td><td>—</td><td>Descriptive Common; kobyss territory</td></tr>
+<tr><td>The Undersea</td><td>—</td><td>Descriptive Common; underground sea</td></tr>
+</table>
+
+<div class="note">
+<strong>Arathi possessive naming pattern:</strong> Several Hallowfall places follow the pattern
+[Personal Name] + <em>-'s</em> + [Common noun]: <em>Dunelle's Kindness</em>, <em>Sina's Yearning</em>,
+<em>Tanir's Ascent</em>, <em>Tenvir's Ascent</em>, <em>Velhan's Claim</em>. This is a Common-language
+construction using the English genitive clitic. The personal names (*Dunelle*, *Sina*, *Tanir*,
+*Tenvir*, *Velhan*) may be Arathi given names following Common phonological patterns.
+</div>
+
 </body>
 </html>

