+  <td>May the Dark Lady watch over us.</td>
+  <td>Attested Forsaken honorific <em>Dark Lady</em> + Common optative construction (no overt modal); <strong>high confidence</strong> — this exact phrase type is common in Forsaken NPC dialogue</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gs2</td>
