 <h2 id="ethereal">Ethereal / Broker</h2>
 
+<p>Based on the grammar in <a href="ethereal/grammar.md">ethereal/grammar.md</a>.
+Key patterns used: *-esh* / *-aresh* locative suffix; *-ii* plural suffix; apostrophe as morpheme boundary;
+Arabic-inspired phonological patterns (deliberate Blizzard design); *Nexus-* title prefix.
+Ethereal has <strong>no attested sentences at all</strong> — the entire corpus consists of proper names
+and place names. All constructions below are compound juxtapositions using inferred morphemes.</p>
