-<h3>Evolutionary Chain</h3>
+<p>This language family is <strong>entirely separate</strong> from both the titan-forged family
+and the Aqir-descended family. Key linguistic findings:</p>
+<ul>
+<li>The family shows a <strong>rise and fall</strong> of linguistic complexity: murloc &rarr; jinyu (expansion), jinyu &rarr; ankoan (simplification), ankoan &rarr; kobyss (near-total language loss)</li>
+<li>The kobyss represent the only known case in WoW of <strong>linguistic regression</strong> in a descended race</li>
+<li>The Gutter kobyss tribe has documented contact with nerubians (the alchemist <em>Al'kubian</em> studied them)</li>
+</ul>
+<p>See <a href="../nerglish/">nerglish/</a> for full vocabulary, grammar, and description files.</p>
 
