+<li>Nightborne names sometimes use apostrophes as morpheme boundaries (<em>Ly'leth</em>, <em>Tel'anor'ien</em>), consistent with the elven family's compounding pattern.</li>
 <li>The Nightborne joined the Horde after the Legion expansion, which may introduce Orcish and Troll loanwords over time <span class="inferred">(inferred)</span>.</li>
 </ul>
 
