-<h2 id="phonology">Phonology</h2>
+<h3 id="andu-endu-negation">The <em>Andu</em> / <em>Endu</em> Negation Pattern</h3>
 
-<h3 id="sound-inventory">Sound Inventory (Observed)</h3>
+<p>The pair <em>Andu</em> / <em>Endu</em> suggests a systematic negation alternation in Darnassian:</p>
 
-<p><strong>Consonants</strong>:</p>
-
 <table>
 <thead>
-<tr><th>Grapheme</th><th>IPA</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
