 <h2 id="writing">Writing System</h2>
 
 <p>Orcish has no widely attested writing system in canon. In-game, orcish text is rendered in the Common (Latin) alphabet. The RPG and expanded lore reference runic or carved inscriptions, but no systematic orcish script has been published by Blizzard.</p>
 
