+<tr><td><strong>Glishi'ma</strong></td><td class="ipa">/ˈɡliːʃimə/</td><td>Haranir</td><td>Apostrophe compound: <span class="inferred">*Glishi'*</span> + <span class="inferred">*-ma*</span>. The *-ma* ending is unattested elsewhere</td></tr>
