+<tr><td><strong>Imhayo</strong></td><td class="ipa">/ɪmˈhɑːjoʊ/</td><td>Haranir</td><td>No apostrophe; /h/ in medial position</td></tr>
+<tr><td><strong>Envoy Ir'ayi</strong></td><td class="ipa">/ɪrˈɑːji/</td><td>Envoy</td><td>"Envoy" Common title; apostrophe compound: <span class="inferred">*Ir'*</span> + <span class="inferred">*-ayi*</span>. The *-ayi* ending is unattested elsewhere</td></tr>
