+<p>Wildcamp Ul'ar is located near the City of Threads in Azj-Kahet, placing Haranir and nerubians in direct geographic proximity. This section analyzes whether any Haranir morphemes could be nerubian loanwords.</p>
 
+<h4>The <em>-ar</em> Element in <em>Ul'ar</em></h4>
+
+<p>The place name <span class="inferred">*Ul'ar*</span> (<span class="ipa">/ʊlˈɑːr/</span>) decomposes as <span class="inferred">*Ul'*</span> + <span class="inferred">*-ar*</span>. The <span class="inferred">*-ar*</span> suffix parallels the nerubian <span class="inferred">*-ar*</span> faction suffix attested in five nerubian names:</p>
