+
+<p>In <em>Ande'thoras-ethil</em>, <em>ethil</em> is confirmed as "diminished/lessened." In <em>Irana'ethil</em> ("Shield against the Shadow"), <em>-ethil</em> may mean "that which diminishes [the shadow]" &rarr; "shield/ward." This is a natural agentive derivation. <em>Ban'ethil</em> (barrow den) could mean "ward of preparation" if <em>Ban-</em> relates to <em>Bandu</em> (imperative).</p>
