+
+<p>This paradigm predicts a fourth form <strong>Bande</strong> (2nd person optative), unattested but expected given the corpus size.</p>
+
+<p><strong>Confidence: Low&ndash;Moderate</strong> for a systematic imperative paradigm. The strongest evidence is the shared <em>-ndV</em> core, which is phonologically distinctive enough that coincidence is unlikely.</p>
