+| *Aran* | Ameth'Aran, Bashal'Aran, Loreth'Aran, Morlos'Aran, Ordil'Aran, Shal'Aran, Tethris Aran | "Town / settlement" | Moderate–High (7 independent attestations; confirmed by wiki speculation; also in Biel'aran) |
