+<p><strong>Updated analysis (Round 19):</strong> Darnassian grammar Investigation 14 provides a systematic
+analysis of <em>-ah</em> as a Proto-Elven derivational suffix. Three cognate pairs are analyzed:</p>
+
+<table>
+<thead>
+<tr><th>Root</th><th>+ <em>-ah</em> form</th><th>Proposed function</th></tr>
