+<tr><td><em>fal</em> (balance/break)</td><td><em>falah/fallah</em></td><td>Nominalized: "balance" → "state of balance / breaking"</td></tr>
+</tbody>
+</table>
+
+<p>The productivity test shows: (1) all three roots are CVC/CV — <em>-ah</em> attaches to simple
